('DR-3C-18','Draw or place a straight ground line perpendicular to the target. Put the ball on the line unless the drill specifies otherwise, apply face spray and use a mid-iron.','1. Place the ball on the ground line and identify the target-side contact zone.
2. Hit a three-quarter shot, then mark where the divot or brush began.
