('DR-3C-20','Draw or place a straight ground line perpendicular to the target. Put the ball on the line unless the drill specifies otherwise, apply face spray and use a mid-iron.','1. Apply face spray and hit balls at controlled speed.
2. Check and mark strike after every ball.
