('DR-3C-27','Choose a clear target, verify alignment and use the club named by the coach or a mid-iron. Start at a speed that allows the club path task to be recognised.','1. Choose the required start and curve for each ball before addressing it.
2. Build alignment, then make one rehearsal matching face and path to that shape.
