('DR-3C-28','Choose a clear target, verify alignment and use the club named by the coach or a mid-iron. Start at a speed that allows the club path task to be recognised.','1. Begin at roughly 60% effort and hit three balls.
2. Increase effort by about 10% only when club path and strike remain in the task window.
