('DR-3C-29','Choose three targets with clearly different directions. Place one alignment reference at the hitting area but rebuild the body and face alignment for every shot.','1. Select a different target before each ball.
2. Walk behind the ball, choose the start line and rebuild alignment from the beginning.
3. Make one task-specific rehearsal, then hit.
