('DR-3C-31','Place a small marker beside each foot so stance width can be rebuilt. Start with feet close enough to make the step or pressure shift obvious and use a short iron.','1. Mark a scoring corridor and one prohibited side.
2. Award points for target, functional corridor and preferred side; subtract for the prohibited miss.
