('DR-4A-03','Set one centre target plus reference targets either side. Begin with a mid-iron and identify the leftward or less rightward window required for each ball.','1. Hit one baseline ball.
2. Make an exaggerated rehearsal sending the clubface and start line leftward or less rightward.
3. Hit the paired ball with the same exaggerated intention.
