('DR-5-28','Draw or place a straight ground line perpendicular to the target. Put the ball on the line unless the drill specifies otherwise, apply face spray and use a mid-iron.','1. Hit one ball with the iron task and record it.
2. Change target, select the driver and rebuild its ball position and alignment.
